      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<p>Honestly, i hope he doesn&#39;t mess with the GUI too much. Speech bubbles will be cool, and the occasion interface screw, but only on HIS area. If it happens when the menu button, rewind, or other not Guise buttons are hit then it can get a little tedious. Remember the &quot;Arrow in the knee&quot; skit? It was funny for a bit, and then lost its charm.</p><p>That&#39;s what I hope they don&#39;t do.&nbsp;</p><p>The second and very much more petty reason is that I don&#39;t want Guise to have the only fun animations or interactions.... what makes HIM so special? Huh?&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
