      "created_at": "2016-04-06T15:43:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think Guise's \"encroachment\" of character areas should only be for his cards that affect or copy other players. &nbsp;Like \"Uh, Yeah, I'm that Guy\" or \"I can do that, too!\" should have a Guise in the background of that character's play area, or maybe have Guise's portrait change to a facimile of that character. &nbsp;\"Let me See That\" should have an \"IOU\" sticky note over the card in the owner's play area.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And I want Guise to have his own sound effects when playing AA's instruments. &nbsp;If for nothing else than my own personal amusement.</p>",
